Dictionary engines
------------------

Kimochi does not include any pop-up dictionary engine. When you choose one,
Kimochi downloads that engine's own, unmodified release asset from its
upstream GitHub release, checks it against a pinned SHA-256 and every
unpacked file against a pinned hash list (extensions/<id>.source.json and
extensions/<id>.sha256.json in Kimochi's source), and runs it unmodified.
Each engine's licence and notices are part of that download; its source is
the upstream tag named below. All three are licensed GPL-3.0-or-later.

Kimochi's source keeps small copies of some upstream metadata files so that
it can host the engines: each engine's manifest.json
(extensions/<id>.manifest.json; the Hachidori and 10ten manifests are compiled
into Kimochi) and 10ten's English _locales/en/messages.json
(extensions/tenten.messages-en.json, used by tests only). These copies are
from the releases named below and remain under GPL-3.0-or-later.

Yomitan: https://github.com/yomidevs/yomitan (GPL-3.0-or-later)
Not included in Kimochi. When you choose it, Kimochi downloads release
26.8.24.0 (commit 77e200428902abf4fa48284df92da7af3dcb4162, asset
yomitan-chrome.zip, SHA-256
99d3ac05e09b09d19b1ecd22da2ebca4fc8cfce1d95d029b5a18d87aff632147) from
https://github.com/yomidevs/yomitan/releases and runs it unmodified. Its
legal notices (legal.html, legal-npm.html) are part of that download.
Source: the upstream tag 26.8.24.0.

Hachidori: https://github.com/bee-san/hachidori (GPL-3.0-or-later)
Not included in Kimochi. When you choose it, Kimochi downloads release 0.3.0
(commit 51eb85486fd9d9b00561c623bbc6defa60853f16, asset
hachidori-0.3.0-51eb85486fd9-chrome.zip, SHA-256
9345e6acf1b31a2d7bdecc423439a57e5c97f3ad188bcc2d6e5368642703bf8e) from
https://github.com/bee-san/hachidori/releases and runs it unmodified. Its
LICENSE, THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and licenses/ (notices for Hoshidicts,
Zstandard, zip.js, Emscripten, musl, LLVM runtimes, KANJIDIC2 under
CC BY-SA 4.0 and others) are part of that download; SOURCE.json names the
matching corresponding-source archive. Source: the upstream tag 0.3.0.

10ten Japanese Reader: https://github.com/birchill/10ten-ja-reader
(GPL-3.0-or-later). Not included in Kimochi. When you choose it, Kimochi
downloads release v1.28.0 (commit 05e9fe2815de2eb1c7807b3d7bebdef456cbb5d1,
asset 10ten-ja-reader-1.28.0-chrome.zip, SHA-256
9ce5dcf9930c6dbb5988dbb25e088150dcd77d70cfee70af448df5c8420cbede) from
https://github.com/birchill/10ten-ja-reader/releases and runs it unmodified.
Its fonts carry their licences beside them (fonts/*.LICENSE.txt in the
